#. L_ARK_009
msgid "Access foyer elevator\n"
msgstr "第１エレベーターに乗り込め\n"

#. L_ARK_010
msgid "Reactivate office elevator\n"
msgstr "第２エレベーターを再起動\n"

#. L_ARK_011
msgid "Destroy dataDyne hovercopter\n"
msgstr "ホバーコプターを撃ち落とせ\n"

#. L_ARK_012
msgid "Defeat Cassandra's bodyguards\n"
msgstr "ボディガードを全て倒せ\n"

#. L_ARK_013
msgid "Rendezvous at helipad\n"
msgstr "脱出のためヘリポートに戻れ\n"

#. L_ARK_014
msgid "Accessing elevator controls...\n"
msgstr "エレベーター管理システムにアクセス中…\n"

#. L_ARK_015
msgid "LIGHTS ARE NOW ON!\n"
msgstr "照明ＯＮ\n"

#. L_ARK_016
msgid "Dr. Caroll has been killed!\n"
msgstr "ドクター・キャロルが倒された！\n"

#. L_ARK_017
msgid "Dr. Caroll is under attack!\n"
msgstr "ドクター・キャロルが攻撃されている！\n"

#. L_ARK_018
msgid "Dr. Caroll has been damaged!\n"
msgstr "ドクター・キャロルがダメージを受けた！\n"

#. L_ARK_019
msgid "Too late! She's here...\n"
msgstr "あぁダメだ…　あの女、もうそこにいるぞ！\n"

#. L_ARK_020
msgid "You've become quite an annoyance...\n"
msgstr "ずいぶん余計なことばかりしてくれるじゃないの…\n"

#. L_ARK_021
msgid "Good night, Ms. Dark.\n"
msgstr "おやすみなさい、ダークちゃん。\n"

#. L_ARK_022
msgid "LIGHTS NOW ON\n"
msgstr "照明ＯＮ\n"

#. L_ARK_023
msgid "LIGHTS NOW OFF\n"
msgstr "照明ＯＦＦ\n"

#. L_ARK_024
msgid "MISSION FAILED\n"
msgstr "任務失敗\n"

#. L_ARK_025
msgid "MISSION SUCCESSFUL\n"
msgstr "任務完了\n"

#. L_ARK_026
msgid "Helichopper warning goes here.\n"
msgstr "Helichopper warning goes here.\n"

#. L_ARK_027
msgid "Obtain Night Vision.\n"
msgstr "Obtain Night Vision.\n"

#. L_ARK_028
msgid "Cassandra De Vries'\n"
msgstr "Cassandra De Vries'\n"

#. L_ARK_029
msgid "Night Vision\n"
msgstr "ナイトアイ\n"

#. L_ARK_030
msgid "Night Vision\n"
msgstr "ナイトアイ\n"

#. L_ARK_031
msgid "Picked up Night Vision.\n"
msgstr "ナイトアイを手に入れた\n"

#. L_ARK_032
msgid "We meet again, girl!\n"
msgstr "また会ったわね、お嬢チャン！\n"

#. L_ARK_033
msgid "Foyer elevator accessed.\n"
msgstr "第１エレベーターへのアクセス完了\n"

#. L_ARK_034
msgid "Office elevator door has been unlocked.\n"
msgstr "第２エレベーターのロックが解除された\n"

#. L_ARK_035
msgid "DataDyne Hovercopter eliminated.\n"
msgstr "ホバーコプターの破壊完了\n"

#. L_ARK_036
msgid "Cassandra's bodyguards have been defeated.\n"
msgstr "カサンドラのボディーガードを全て倒した\n"

#. L_ARK_037
msgid "That's not how it goes.\n"
msgstr "そうやって使うんじゃないだろ？\n"

#. L_ARK_038
msgid "Yes, it is.\n"
msgstr "いや、これでいいんだぜ。\n"

#. L_ARK_039
msgid "Give it to me - you're doing it wrong.\n"
msgstr "貸せよ、絶対間違ってるよ。\n"

#. L_ARK_040
msgid "Stop annoying me.\n"
msgstr "ジャマするなって！\n"

#. L_ARK_041
msgid "Will you just hurry up!\n"
msgstr "何でもいいから早くしろ！\n"

#. L_ARK_042
msgid "Oh, no...too late.\n"
msgstr "アワワ、もう手遅れだ…\n"

#. L_ARK_043
msgid "She's here...\n"
msgstr "あの女、そこにいるぞ！\n"

#. L_ARK_044
msgid "Get her!\n"
msgstr "つかまえろ！\n"

#. L_ARK_045
msgid "Critical mission object destroyed. \n"
msgstr "任務遂行に不可欠な要素が破壊された\n"

#. L_ARK_046
msgid "Obtain CamSpy.\n"
msgstr "Obtain CamSpy.\n"

#. L_ARK_047
msgid "Dr. Caroll's\n"
msgstr "Dr. Caroll's\n"

#. L_ARK_048
msgid "CamSpy\n"
msgstr "カムスパイ\n"

#. L_ARK_049
msgid "A CamSpy\n"
msgstr "カムスパイ\n"

#. L_ARK_050
msgid "Picked up a CamSpy.\n"
msgstr "カムスパイを手に入れた\n"

#. L_ARK_051
msgid ""
"They've locked down the ground floor - \n"
"get to the elevator!\n"
msgstr ""
"玄関は完全にロックされているぞ。\n"
"第１エレベーターへと向かうのだ！\n"

#. L_ARK_052
msgid ""
"That copter needs to be taken out, or \n"
"the jumpship'll get shot down!\n"
msgstr ""
"そのヘリは破壊するのだ。\n"
"輸送部隊がやられてしまうぞ！\n"

#. L_ARK_053
msgid "I can't leave any bodyguards standing.\n"
msgstr "全く逃げ場がないようね…\n"

#. L_ARK_054
msgid ""
"Don't keep the jumpship waiting - \n"
"get back to the landing pad.\n"
msgstr ""
"これ以上輸送部隊を待たせるな。\n"
"早くヘリポートへ急ぐのだ！\n"

#. L_ARK_055
msgid "Obtain alpha key card.\n"
msgstr "Obtain alpha key card.\n"

#. L_ARK_056
msgid "Guard's\n"
msgstr "Guard's\n"

#. L_ARK_057
msgid "Office key card\n"
msgstr "カードキー\n"

#. L_ARK_058
msgid "Office key card\n"
msgstr "カードキー\n"

#. L_ARK_059
msgid "Picked up Cassandra's office key card.\n"
msgstr ""
"カサンドラのオフィスの\n"
"カードキーを手に入れた\n"

#. L_ARK_060
msgid "Sound the alarm - she's here!\n"
msgstr "アラームを！　ヤツが来たぞ！\n"

#. L_ARK_061
msgid "Lights out!\n"
msgstr "消灯の時間よ！\n"

#. L_ARK_062
msgid "What the...?\n"
msgstr "これは、一体…\n"

#. L_ARK_063
msgid "Going somewhere?\n"
msgstr "どこにお出かけかしら？\n"

#. L_ARK_064
msgid "Something I can do for you, old woman?\n"
msgstr "私に何か用、オバサマ？\n"

#. L_ARK_065
msgid ""
"Return our sapient immediately! You don't \n"
"know what you're doing.\n"
msgstr ""
"そのＡＩを今すぐ返しな！\n"
"何をしているか、わかってるのかい！\n"

#. L_ARK_066
msgid "Yes I do. I'm leaving.\n"
msgstr ""
"何をって？\n"
"脱出するだけよ。\n"

#. L_ARK_067
msgid ""
"One more chance! Give it back, and you \n"
"could come and work for me.\n"
msgstr ""
"もう１回言うわ、返しなさい！\n"
"そして、私の下で働くといいわ…\n"

#. L_ARK_068
msgid "Sorry! Gotta shoot.\n"
msgstr "悪いわね、急いでるの。\n"

#. L_ARK_069
msgid ""
"You must get the sapient back. We cannot \n"
"proceed without it.\n"
msgstr ""
"あのＡＩを必ず取り返すのだ。\n"
"あれがなくては計画が進まないぞ！\n"

#. L_ARK_070
msgid "I know that!\n"
msgstr "わかってるわ！\n"

#. L_ARK_071
msgid ""
"I also know who to talk to... \n"
"Mr. Carrington.\n"
msgstr ""
"誰に話をすればいいか、わかってるわ。\n"
"…ミスター・キャリントンよ。\n"

#. L_ARK_072
msgid "Elevator door is inactive on this floor.\n"
msgstr "このフロアーのエレベーターのドアはロックされています。\n"
